        { "Perfecting the Corkscrew allows its pure power to shock opponents if they are hit while trying to punch. Unlocking makes your 'Corkscrew Blow' do more stun to your opponent if they hit while they are punching.", "Perfeccionar el Corkscrew hace que su potencia conmocione al rival si lo alcanzas mientras intenta golpear. Al desbloquearla, tu 'Corkscrew Blow' aturde mÃ¡s si alcanza al rival mientras golpea.", "AperfeiÃ§oar o Corkscrew faz sua forÃ§a chocar o adversÃ¡rio se ele for atingido enquanto tenta socar. Ao desbloquear, seu 'Corkscrew Blow' atordoa mais se acertar o adversÃ¡rio enquanto ele soca.", "Perfectionner le Corkscrew permet Ã  sa puissance de sonner l'adversaire touchÃ© en pleine attaque. Une fois dÃ©bloquÃ©e, ton Â« Corkscrew Blow Â» Ã©tourdit davantage s'il touche l'adversaire pendant qu'il frappe.", "Ein perfektionierter Corkscrew schockt den Gegner mit purer Kraft, wenn er beim Schlagen getroffen wird. Freigeschaltet betÃ¤ubt dein â€žCorkscrew Blowâ€œ stÃ¤rker, wenn er den Gegner beim Schlagen trifft.", "ã‚³ãƒ¼ã‚¯ã‚¹ã‚¯ãƒªãƒ¥ãƒ¼ã‚’æ¥µã‚ã‚‹ã¨ã€ãƒ‘ãƒ³ãƒã‚’æ‰“ã¨ã†ã¨ã—ãŸç›¸æ‰‹ã‚’ãã®å¨åŠ›ã§ç—ºã‚Œã•ã›ã‚‹ã€‚è§£æ”¾ã™ã‚‹ã¨ã€ç›¸æ‰‹ã®ãƒ‘ãƒ³ãƒä¸­ã«å½“ã¦ãŸã€Œã‚³ãƒ¼ã‚¯ã‚¹ã‚¯ãƒªãƒ¥ãƒ¼ãƒ»ãƒ–ãƒ­ãƒ¼ã€ã®ã‚¹ã‚¿ãƒ³ãŒå¤§ãããªã‚‹ã€‚", "ì½•ìŠ¤í¬ë£¨ë¥¼ ì™„ì„±í•˜ë©´ íŽ€ì¹˜ë¥¼ ì¹˜ë ¤ë˜ ìƒëŒ€ë¥¼ ê·¸ ìœ„ë ¥ìœ¼ë¡œ ì¶©ê²©ì— ë¹ ëœ¨ë¦°ë‹¤. í•´ê¸ˆí•˜ë©´ ìƒëŒ€ê°€ íŽ€ì¹˜ë¥¼ ì¹˜ëŠ” ì¤‘ì— ë§žížŒ 'ì½•ìŠ¤í¬ë£¨ ë¸”ë¡œ'ì˜ ìŠ¤í„´ì´ ì»¤ì§„ë‹¤." },
